# M091 registers every digest-bearing artifact it may ever write in the same commit as its frozen
# protocol, before any of them exists. The wildcards above already cover PROTOCOL and RESULT; the
# qualification draw, the register claim and any superseded run are named here so that no later
# commit reintroduces the checkout-dependent hash defect by forgetting one.
experiments/M091/PROTOCOL.json -text
