# M092 freezes the state-owned substrate separately before any extension or qualification. Register
# every digest-bearing path at the checkpoint boundary and force canonical LF bytes so later M092-B
# artifacts cannot repeat the checkout-dependent commitment defect seen in M064/M086-A.
